                            {
                                "example_id": "63dd9a47-d995-4099-b703-995c30d3009a",
                                "sense_id": "f2756fbf-c683-3d23-9668-2af8d9190dab",
                                "text": "In both the 2005 and 2013 papal elections there were whispers circulating that back in 1976 Francis had failed to help the two priests in their hour of need."
